_computing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quantum_computing)\n*   **Wikipedia.** *Noisy Intermediate-Scale Quantum Computing.* [en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noisy_intermediate-scale_quantum_computing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noisy_intermediate-scale_quantum_computing)\n*   **United Nations.** *2025: International Year of Quantum Science and Technology.* [unesco.org](https://www.unesco.org/)', 'extras': {'signature': 'EjQKMgEMOdbHHfQT5mioNxQyzOjAvIZGsAmGKOPzKubFuKYB3OhWy/kdGdsZPgBLBk1U7e60'}}]
